Package: fhperf
Title: Performance Metrics and SPC Charts for the Fake NHS Trust
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Claude", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "noreply@anthropic.com")
Description: A catalogue of performance metrics for the Fake NHS Trust synthetic
    hospital dataset. Each metric is a YAML file that composes one or two
    components; each component is a YAML file plus a SQL query that returns one
    row per event. The package reads the events, aggregates them into
    numerators and denominators by period, and shapes the result for
    'NHSRplotthedots' SPC charts. A Quarto site in site/ renders every metric.
